- `autom9-extension/src/components/ChatPanel.svelte`

**Modified:**
- `autom9-backend/app/main.py` — added `chat_router`, `ProviderError` import, `provider_error_handler`
- `autom9-extension/src/App.svelte` — imported and rendered `ChatPanel`

